From 8ef262dc605ee81db9eef4c0b14491137b10c23c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: chenpoyu0109 <chenpoyu0109@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 18:19:50 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Add voice web message handler for Chinese STT/TTS
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Adds a "voice" TPWebMessageHandler so micro-service pages in the WebView
can use native Chinese speech recognition (speech_to_text) and
text-to-speech (flutter_tts) via flutterObject, since Android WebView
does not support the browser SpeechRecognition API.

- Actions: startListening, stopListening, speak, stopSpeaking
- Events: listeningStarted, listeningStopped, speechResult,
  speechError, speakingStarted, speakingCompleted, speakingStopped
- Sends the last non-empty partial as final when the Google service
  ends with error_client and no final result
- Adds RECORD_AUDIO/INTERNET permissions, speech service queries,
  iOS usage descriptions, and a pinned "語音助理" service entry
  (URL via --dart-define=VOICE_ASSISTANT_URL)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
