From f8ebeb1925c4d692fabada85c29c3d885f8b27f5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: chenpoyu0109 <chenpoyu0109@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 18:30:45 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] Stop voice when leaving the WebView or app goes to
 background

Wrap InAppWebView in VoiceLifecycleGuard, which calls
VoiceBridge.stopAll() on dispose and when the app is paused/hidden,
and drops the reply channel so no events reach a closed page.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
