Subject: [PATCH 3/4] Hybrid speech recognition: Google online, Whisper offline

- online + system recognizer available: speech_to_text (Google), fast
- offline or no Google service: record 16 kHz WAV, then transcribe on
  device with Whisper base via whisper_ggml (whisper.cpp, MIT)
- model downloads once (ggml-base, ~148 MB), then works offline
